%[text] # Run simulation with PMSM FEM harness model
%[text] This model is a slightly modified version of the following Simscape Electrical Example.
%[text] - [Import EESM Flux and Loss Data from ANSYS Maxwell](https://www.mathworks.com/help/sps/ug/import-eesm-data-from-maxwell.html) \
%[text] You can open the example using the following command, whcih makes a local copy of the example in a new folder and MATLAB changes the working folder.
%[text] ```matlabCodeExample
%[text] openExample('simscapeelectrical/EESMFromMaxwellExample')
%[text] ```
%[text] 
model_name = "HarnessModel_PmsmFem";
load_system(model_name)

% Open the Scope window to insert the screenshot of it.
open_system(model_name + "/Scope") %[output:28f02f49]

sim(model_name); %[output:28f02f49]
